l.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Prisha Patnaik</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134935138,imgsize-76018.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Abhijieet Dipke, CJP funded by US donors': Singer Mary Millben backs PM Modi; pushes for counter-movement]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/abhijieet-dipke-cjp-funded-by-us-donors-singer-mary-millben-backs-pm-modi-pushes-for-counter-movement/articleshow/134934795.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134934795.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Mary Millben has alleged that US-based donors are funding individuals opposing Prime Minister Narendra Modi. She encouraged young Indians to rise up against disruptive forces and defend democracy. Millben highlighted a pattern among some US donors targeting conservative leaders globally. BJP leaders have raised questions about the funding of the Cockroach Janta Party and its founder. Dipke has denied allegations of receiving foreign funds, challenging government oversight.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/abhijieet-dipke-cjp-funded-by-us-donors-singer-mary-millben-backs-pm-modi-pushes-for-counter-movement/articleshow/134934795.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/abhijieet-dipke-cjp-funded-by-us-donors-singer-mary-millben-backs-pm-modi-pushes-for-counter-movement/articleshow/134934795.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-14T12:17:13+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Aryan Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134934914,imgsize-127160.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Rahul Gandhi told us to be ready at 24 hours notice for protest: Anish Gawande slams CJP leaders' arrests]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/rahul-gandh